12
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:41,560
What are the eyes for?

13
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,200
Are you going to apply for regularization today?

14
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:50,320
The BOSS said that he would be looking for you if he becomes a full-time employee.
